    # ATTRIBUTION.toml: one entry per asset (AGENTS.md §1). The source of truth for provenance and licences.
    # ATTRIBUTION.md is generated from this file: `cargo xtask assets --write`. Checked by `cargo xtask assets` (part of `xtask ci`).
    #
    # [[asset]]    a file in this repository (committed or vendored); `sha256` must match the file.
    # [[bundled]]  a file compiled into PdfCraft by a Cargo dependency (its crate version must match Cargo.lock).
